ly acceptance pass without persisting private data"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/definition_of_ready","value":"All-status PM lineage and duplicate search are complete; Jellyfin 10.11.11 is confirmed latest stable; local main is refreshed; owner-only global profile exists."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"jf-mqpo"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Give humans and LLM agents enough machine-readable contract detail to invoke every OpenAPI operation correctly on the first attempt."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Reduces invalid requests and dangerous guesswork while making the generic all-API executor genuinely usable in automated workflows."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"Exact Jellyfin operation inspection becomes a complete, deterministic invocation contract rather than a shallow name list."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The live coverage report maps all 429 operations, but current exact inspection omits the schemas and response/security details agents need to use that coverage safely."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"jf-gn5j"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reviewer","value":"github-review-bots"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/sprint","value":"jellyfin-10.11.11"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/release","value":"next-manual-release"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"jf-0ea5","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-31T20:20:37.363Z","author":"codex-jellyfin-contracts","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"jf-7sjs","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-31T20:20:37.363Z","author":"codex-jellyfin-contracts","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"jf-axko","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-31T20:20:37.363Z","author":"codex-jellyfin-contracts","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_sour